@namespace Lumeo.Docs.Shared.Showcases
@* Static exception (see ../README.md): RichTextEditor mounts TipTap/ProseMirror via a
   heavy JS engine (editor core + extensions) that needs a real browser runtime to
   initialize, not something a catalog card should bootstrap. The toolbar below is the
   REAL Toolbar/Button components (so it's genuinely interactive chrome); only the
   editor body is a faithful static rendition of typical WYSIWYG output, in theme
   tokens, standing in for the ProseMirror document. *@

<div class="w-full max-w-[22rem] rounded-md border border-border overflow-hidden">
    <Toolbar Class="border-0 border-b border-border rounded-none px-1.5 py-1">
        <Button Variant="Button.ButtonVariant.Ghost" Size="Button.ButtonSize.Sm">
            <DynamicIcon Name="Bold" Class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </Button>
        <Button Variant="Button.ButtonVariant.Ghost" Size="Button.ButtonSize.Sm">
            <DynamicIcon Name="Italic" Class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </Button>
        <Button Variant="Button.ButtonVariant.Ghost" Size="Button.ButtonSize.Sm">
            <DynamicIcon Name="List" Class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </Button>
    </Toolbar>
    <div class="bg-background px-3 py-2.5 text-sm">
        <p class="font-semibold text-foreground">Release notes</p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-muted-foreground">Ship the new onboarding flow and fix the <strong class="text-foreground">sidebar</strong> collapse bug.</p>
    </div>
</div>
